Afro beat, Afro pop Contemporary Gospel and Soul track at 105 BPM in the key of G Major. The arrangement features a clean electric guitar playing rhythmic, muted strums and occasional melodic fills. A deep, punchy electric bass locks with a drum kit featuring a crisp snare and a steady kick. Lush violin harmonies from a choir provide a thick texture behind a soulful lead violin. Shakers and handclaps add rhythmic layers during the chorus. The production is clean with moderate reverb on the vocals and a bright, polished high-end. Keep the original emotional and spiritual core intact while naturally inserting a high-energy cello feature that escalates the intensity. The cello maintains the song’s themes (divine spark, breaking illusions/chains, knowledge as power, faith as fire) but adds sharper violin, rhythmic drive typical of a strong rap verse. The beat switch suggestion helps it feel like a true feature moment.


